 "intro_zh": "赤水丹霞旅游区由赤水大瀑布、佛光岩、燕子岩三大景区组成，区内瀑布成群、丹霞奇丽、竹林似海、桫椤繁茂、森林壮阔，是一个集山、谷、瀑、河、珍稀动植物为一体的丹霞地貌旅游区。",
 "intro_en": "Chishui Danxia Tourist Area is composed of three major scenic spots: Chishui Waterfall, Foguang Rock, and Swallow Rock. The area has clusters of waterfalls, beautiful Danxia, ​​sea-like bamboo forests, luxuriant algae, and magnificent forests. It is a Danxia landform tourist area integrating mountains, valleys, waterfalls, rivers, and rare animals and plants.",
